      "onFailure": "publishFailure() maps DurablePublishError.stage onto the save outcome and keeps the OS code: write-failed, durability-failed, publish-failed, or identity-collision for EEXIST. A full disk surfaces as write-failed with code ENOSPC rather than as a generic failure, and the scrollback staged for the set is discarded so no manifest points at a half-sealed copy. This is the pattern the rest of the estate is being brought up to.",
